00:02:38.867 --> 00:02:42.245
Like, how much do you have to do to get into it?

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:44.622
Do you buy like a certain amount?

00:02:44.622 --> 00:02:45.915
- Well, I mean, it just depends

00:02:45.915 --> 00:02:47.876
