00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.005
And if you get in early enough

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:53.131
and you want to put

00:02:53.131 --> 00:02:54.799
a certain amount of bread into it, go ahead.

00:02:54.799 --> 00:02:57.635
But like, I'll show you, my biggest NFT success story

00:02:57.635 --> 00:02:59.137
