00:03:02.891 --> 00:03:04.475
So I bought it for two ethereum at the time,

00:03:04.475 --> 00:03:05.727
which is four grand.

00:03:05.727 --> 00:03:07.187
- [Toppin:] Two of what?
- Two ethereum,

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:08.730
which is four grand at the time.
- [Napheesa Collier:] That's so crazy.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.899
- That's ETH?
- Yeah.

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:13.067
- [All laughing]
- [Collier:] That's crazy.
- [Barnes:] You really gotta put your trust into it, though.

00:03:13.067 --> 00:03:16.696
