00:03:27.457 --> 00:03:30.501
- [Wade:] Yeah, you did.
- I put my Bored Ape on the kicks and that blew up.

00:03:30.501 --> 00:03:32.629
- The reason NFTs are gonna work is they work more

00:03:32.629 --> 00:03:34.672
like fashion than they do like Wall Street.

00:03:34.672 --> 00:03:38.426
The NBA player today sits at the tippy-top

00:03:38.426 --> 00:03:42.222
